<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606107138" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
